# CASM Phase 13 WP83 trusted reference: casmassert1
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmassert1 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves
# .ASSERT emits zero bytes on a passing assertion -- the following .BYTE
# lands immediately after the .ORG load-address header with nothing
# in between.
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address -- no relocatable symbols involved):
#   .ORG $C000
#   .ASSERT 1    ; resolves to 1 (nonzero) -- passes, emits nothing
#   .BYTE $AA
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0        PRG load-address header ($C000, little-endian)
#   AA           .BYTE $AA (.ASSERT contributed no bytes)
#
# bytes: 3

00 C0
AA
